# Production Build Configuration for IIS Server Deployment
# When running 'npm run build', Vite will embed these variables.
# Note: If left blank or commented out, the application will automatically connect to port 5191
# on whatever hostname/IP address served the frontend (e.g. http://192.168.1.50:5191/api).
# You can also change the API URL post-deployment anytime in C:\inetpub\wwwroot\...\runtime-config.js!

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://YOUR_SERVER_IP:5191/api